 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "ko": "기술 관련 표현 (use, send, download)",
   "en": "Technology phrases (use, send, download)"
  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "기기와 인터넷에 관한 말은 대부분 일반동사 현재형을 씁니다: use, send, download. he / she에는 -s를 붙입니다. 기기가 안 될 때는 doesn't work라고 말합니다.",
   "en": "Most talk about devices and the internet uses the present simple: use, send, download. With he / she add -s. When something doesn't work say doesn't work."
  },
  "table": {
   "head": [
    "표현 / Pattern",
    "예 / Example"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "use + 기기",
     "I use a computer."
    ],
    [
     "send + 이메일",
     "She sends an email."
    ],
    [
     "Is there ~?",
     "Is there Wi-Fi here?"
    ],
    [
     "doesn't work",
     "My phone doesn't work."
    ]
   ]
  },
  "notes": [
   {
    "ko": "on the internet은 '인터넷으로'라는 뜻입니다.",
    "en": "On the internet means using the internet."
   },
   {
    "ko": "Wi-Fi, email처럼 기술 용어는 대문자/소문자에 주의하세요.",
    "en": "Watch the capitals in Wi-Fi, email, internet."
   },
   {
    "ko": "he / she에는 uses, sends, downloads.",
    "en": "With he / she: uses, sends, downloads."
   }
  ],
